    {
      "id": "94969aa3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 字符串\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a453c51",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**字符串**是字符的有限序列。**Julia** 中用于字符串的内置类型是`String`类型。它通过UTF-8编码支持完整的Unicode字符集。\n\n字符串是不可变的：`String`对象的值无法被修改。若要创建不同的字符串值，必须利用其他字符串的片段来构建新的字符串。\n\n字符串值需用**双引号**或**三重双引号**来表示。它们在显示时始终使用双引号。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "486386a2",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "s = \"Hello, world.\""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b0a8dd92",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "s = \"\"\"Expression \"in quotes\" within a string\"\"\""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4faf9ac1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "长字符串可以通过在新行前添加反斜杠（`\\`）来拆分为多行。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
